00:05:33,333 --> 00:05:39,333
The death of an icon comes to life

2
00:11:06,666 --> 00:11:12,666
Soaked in Bleach is a music, drama, documentary
film directed by Benjamin Statler.

3
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:46,000
Twenty years ago, Kurt Cobain was found dead of an
apparent gunshot wound to the head.

4
00:22:13,333 --> 00:22:19,333
The world was told it was a suicide, but evidence would lead
many people to believe it might be otherwise.

5
00:27:46,666 --> 00:27:52,666
The film investigates the possibilities that exist that Kurt Cobain's death might not have been a suicide, that the Seattle Police Department rushed their verdict, and the global media perpetuated
lies and misinformation fed to them by Courtney Love that created the belief in many that Cobain killed himself—but when revealed to be lies—lead many to now question what happened.

6
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:26,000
Tom Grant, played by Daniel Roebuck.

7
00:38:53,333 --> 00:38:59,333
Courtney Love, played by Sarah Scott.

8
00:44:26,666 --> 00:44:32,666
Dylan Carson, played by August Emerson.

9
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Himself, played by Kurt Loder.

10
00:55:33,333 --> 00:55:39,333
Kurt Cobain, played by Tyler Bryan.

11
01:01:06,666 --> 01:01:12,666
Rosemary Carroll, played by Julie Lancaster.

12
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:46,000
Soaked in Bleach is a 2015 American docudrama directed by Benjamin Statler, who
co-wrote and produced it with Richard Middelton and Donnie Eichar.

13
01:12:13,333 --> 01:12:19,333
The film details the events leading up to the death of Kurt Cobain, as seen through the perspective of Tom Grant, the
private detective who was hired by Courtney Love to find Cobain, shortly before his death in 1994.

14
01:17:46,666 --> 01:17:52,666
It also explores the theory that Cobain's death was not a suicide.

15
01:23:20,000 --> 01:23:26,000
The film stars Tyler Bryan as Cobain and Daniel Roebuck as Grant, with Sarah
Scott portraying Courtney Love and August Emerson as Dylan Carlson.

16
01:28:53,333 --> 01:28:59,333
The film explores themes of private investigator,
gunshot wound, reneactment, possible suicide.

17
01:34:26,666 --> 01:34:32,666
The tone is emotional.
